  "description": {
   "en": "Aoba Yomogi is a 35-year-old novelist. She is on the precipice as a novelist, and her female editor has suggested that she write a novel on the theme of 'female sex services'. She is shocked by a sudden marriage report from Shinonome, with whom she has had a long-standing relationship, and uses the women's sex industry on the spur of the moment. There she meets Kinjo, a mysterious young man whom Yomogi employs as a housekeeper."
  },
